{"timestamp":"2026-09-01T13:40:15.488044Z","level":"info","event":"    \"applicant_eligibility_description\": \"*Who May Submit Proposals: Proposals may only be submitted by the following:\\n  -Proposals may only be submitted by two-year colleges of higher education (either Associate&rsquo;s College or Baccalaureate / Associate&rsquo;s Colleges) that are accredited and offer undergraduate educational degree programs in science, technology, engineering, and mathematics (STEM).&nbsp; Baccalaureate, Master&rsquo;s, and Doctoral institutions, and Professional Organizations may partner with a two-year college as a subaward or as a collaborator.&nbsp; For all collaborative proposals, two-year colleges must be the lead organization. &nbsp;Please see PAPPG Chapter II.E.3 for additional guidance on collaborative proposals.\",","logger":"task.stdout"}
